10184,,,,39.76296047,-75.63638483,,,,nid_lhd_coordinates,,Red Clay Creek,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Red Clay Creek 4,Delaware,DE,10.0,New Castle County,3.0,10003.0,,,,,,4651912.0,,22603.0,,Confirmed,"USACE, State Dam Safety Office",Verified by DE Dam Safety Office,"DE Dam Safety Office provided data, 9/11/25 email. Dam is located just upstream of Lancaster Pike. There is a natural gas line that runs parallel to Lancaster Pike upstream of the dam as well as an active USGS gage (1974 inventory and 2023 DelDOT report). ",New Castle County,Delaware,19807.0,Red Clay Creek,0.0,"Congressional District 00, Delaware",2.0,204.0,20402.0,2040205.0,Philadelphia District,North Atlantic Division,3.0,New Castle County,,,Concrete,,4.0,4.0,,,85.0,,,,,,DE Dam Safety Office,2025-09-11T12:00:00.000Z,,,,,Red Clay Creek,,,,,,,,,,,,
10185,,,,39.7347831,-75.63415303,,,,nid_lhd_coordinates,,Red Clay Creek,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Red Clay Creek 2,Delaware,DE,10.0,New Castle County,3.0,10003.0,,,,,,4651930.0,,22601.0,,Confirmed,"USACE, State Dam Safety Office",Verified by DE Dam Safety Office,"DE Dam Safety Office provided data, 9/11/25 email.  Dam is located beneath the Kirkwood highway. The orientation of dam is askew to the upstream channel and largely concealed by Kirkwood highway in aerial imagery (1974 inventory and 2023 DelDOT report). ",New Castle County,Delaware,19808.0,Red Clay Creek,1.0,"Congressional District 00, Delaware",2.0,204.0,20402.0,2040205.0,Philadelphia District,North Atlantic Division,3.0,New Castle County,Haveg Industries Inc.,Private,Rockfill,,8.0,8.0,,,160.0,,,,,,DE Dam Safety Office,2025-09-11T12:00:00.000Z,,,,,Red Clay Creek,,,,,,,,,0.07775738409689242,224.38663301096716,0.07775738409689242,224.38663301096716
10186,,,,39.78950404,-75.6438622,,,,nid_lhd_coordinates,,Red Clay Creek,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Red Clay Creek 6,Delaware,DE,10.0,New Castle County,3.0,10003.0,,,,,,4651206.0,,22605.0,,Confirmed,"USACE, State Dam Safety Office",Verified by DE Dam Safety Office,"DE Dam Safety Office provided data, 9/11/25 email. Dam is a masonry-style construction.  A scenic railway crosses Red Clay Creek in the impoundment formed by Dam 6 and runs along the left floodplain (1974 inventory and 2023 DelDOT report). ",New Castle County,Delaware,19807.0,Red Clay Creek,2.0,"Congressional District 00, Delaware",2.0,204.0,20402.0,2040205.0,Philadelphia District,North Atlantic Division,3.0,New Castle County,,,Masonry,,7.0,7.0,,,122.0,,,,,,DE Dam Safety Office,2025-09-11T12:00:00.000Z,,,,,Red Clay Creek,,,,,,,,,,,,
10187,,,,39.80253254,-75.66228631,,,,nid_lhd_coordinates,,Red Clay Creek,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Red Clay Creek 7,Delaware,DE,10.0,New Castle County,3.0,10003.0,,,,,,4651124.0,,22606.0,,Confirmed,"USACE, State Dam Safety Office",Verified by DE Dam Safety Office,"DE Dam Safety Office provided data, 9/11/25 email. The dam is a concrete weir-style construction and is presently breached and remains in disrepair (Figure 16). Due to the failure, the preferential flow path has moved towards the right side of the channel and appears to have changed the orientation of the active flow through Sharpless Road bridge (Figure 17). The breach is approximately 27 feet wide and approximately 3 feet above the downstream water surface elevation on the day of the field visit  (1974 inventory and 2023 DelDOT report). ",New Castle County,Delaware,19707.0,Red Clay Creek,4.0,"Congressional District 00, Delaware",2.0,204.0,20402.0,2040205.0,Philadelphia District,North Atlantic Division,3.0,New Castle County,,,Concrete,,5.0,5.0,,,80.0,,,,,,DE Dam Safety Office,2025-09-11T12:00:00.000Z,,,,,Red Clay Creek,,,,,,,,,,,,
