15752,,,,39.74220433,-75.63241191,,,,nid_lhd_coordinates,,Red Clay Creek,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Red Clay Creek 3,Delaware,DE,10.0,New Castle County,3.0,10003.0,,,,,,4651930.0,,22602.0,,Confirmed not a LHD,"USACE, State Dam Safety Office",Dam Breached,"DE Dam Safety Office provided data, 9/11/25 email.  The dam is a concrete weir-style construction and is presently breached. From google earth images, it appears that the dam failed prior to October 2011 and the breach is roughly 60’ wide and remains about 3 feet above the channel bed. The breaching of the dam lowered the water surface upstream of the dam and exposed a New Castle County sewer line that is capped in concrete in the impoundment (1974 inventory and 2023 DelDOT report). ",New Castle County,Delaware,19808.0,Red Clay Creek,1.0,"Congressional District 00, Delaware",2.0,204.0,20402.0,2040205.0,Philadelphia District,North Atlantic Division,3.0,New Castle County,,,Concrete,,,6.0,4.0,6.0,,,,"Under Investigation, Planning, Permitting, or Design for Remediation",,,DE Dam Safety Office,2025-09-11T12:00:00.000Z,,,,,Red Clay Creek,,,,,,,,,,,,
