15999,,,,36.134276,-96.138184,,,,nid_lhd_coordinates,,Arkansas River,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,Keystone Lake Reregulating Dam,Oklahoma,OK,40.0,Tulsa County,143.0,40143.0,,Sand Springs,,,,369205.0,,25869.0,,Removed,USACE,Dam Removed,"The reregulation dam that was located 8 miles downstream from the Keystone Dam was demolished in 1985.  A 1983 report concerning the purposes of the dam concluded that it had lost its original design function, and that it had proven to be a public safety hazard.  The removal of the dam was accomplished by contract with Bowline Construction Company of Catoosa, Oklahoma at a total cost of $407,748. Tulsa District 11/3/2025 email.",Tulsa County,Oklahoma,74063.0,Arkansas River,,"Congressional District 01, Oklahoma",11.0,1111.0,111101.0,11110101.0,Tulsa District,Southwestern Division,6.0,Tulsa County,USACE - Tulsa District,Federal,,,,,,,,1964.0,,,,,USACE,2025-11-03T12:00:00.000Z,,,,,Arkansas River,,,,,,,,,,,,
